{"ref":"BDB, חָרָה","hw":"חָרָה","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָרָה</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. burn, be kindled, of anger (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חרי</span> Pa. <em>cause</em> fire <em>to burn</em> (rare); Zinj. <span dir=\"rtl\">חרא</span> <em>anger</em>, Nö<sup>ZMG 1893, 98. 103</sup>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَرْوَةٌ</span> <em>burning sensation, in throat</em>, etc., from <em>rage and pain</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:6\" href=\"/Genesis.4.6\">Gn 4:6</a> + 20 times; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחֱרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:11\" href=\"/Exodus.32.11\">Ex 32:11</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִ֫חַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:30\" href=\"/Genesis.18.30\">Gn 18:30</a> + 7 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּ֫חַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:5\" href=\"/Genesis.4.5\">Gn 4:5</a> + 46 times; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָרֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.7\">1 S 20:7</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.1\">2 S 24:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 124:3\" href=\"/Psalms.124.3\">ψ 124:3</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  of man: <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חרה אף</span> (one’s) <em>anger was kindled, burned</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:19\" href=\"/Genesis.39.19\">Gn 39:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:27\" href=\"/Numbers.22.27\">Nu 22:27</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:19\" href=\"/Exodus.32.19\">Ex 32:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:22\" href=\"/Exodus.32.22\">22</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:30\" href=\"/Judges.9.30\">Ju 9:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:19\" href=\"/Judges.14.19\">14:19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.6\">1 S 11:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 32:2\" href=\"/Job.32.2\">Jb 32:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 32:5\" href=\"/Job.32.5\">5</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <em>against</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:2\" href=\"/Genesis.30.2\">Gn 30:2</a>